WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.001
Two ways to add a new news message.

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:06.769
The first is to go to dashboard,
and here in your news block,

00:00:07.569 --> 00:00:10.570
click Add.

00:00:10.754 --> 00:00:14.922
The second is to go to the news
listing on the front end

00:00:15.973 --> 00:00:18.974
and click Add News message.

00:00:19.691 --> 00:00:22.909
This example
I'm going to use a news message

00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:25.910
in from a Google document.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.794
So I'm going to copy it.

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:31.796
And then if I paste it in here

00:00:32.179 --> 00:00:36.081
I'm going to get a bunch of Google
Doc formatting.

00:00:36.081 --> 00:00:37.765
And I don't want that.

00:00:37.765 --> 00:00:40.633
So I am going to go to text edit.

00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:45.051
You can use notepad if you're on a PC.

00:00:46.252 --> 00:00:49.253
Make sure you are in.

00:00:51.204 --> 00:00:53.905
Plain text mode.

00:00:53.905 --> 00:00:56.889
I want to paste it in there.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:01:00.024
I'm going to copy it out again.

00:01:00.024 --> 00:01:03.408
And now this time when I copy it,
it's all the formatting is gone.

00:01:04.826 --> 00:01:07.810
So I'm
going to paste it into the body here.

00:01:08.544 --> 00:01:11.545
And now I need to reformat this.

00:01:23.533 --> 00:01:26.534
I'm going to delete this welcome sentence.

00:01:27.435 --> 00:01:30.653
We want our writing on the web
to be very,

00:01:31.637 --> 00:01:34.638
you know, straightforward and very quick.

00:01:35.155 --> 00:01:38.239
We need to have a title for this.

00:01:42.041 --> 00:01:45.042
And a summary.

00:01:50.061 --> 00:01:52.762
And we need to get our

00:01:52.762 --> 00:01:55.763
links back.

00:02:17.922 --> 00:02:19.973
And now here we have the tags.

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:25.908
Now, this is completely optional, but
what you can do is you can tag your news

00:02:25.908 --> 00:02:28.910
posts, with,

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:32.028
the kind of the categories
that it would fit in.

00:02:32.028 --> 00:02:35.779
You can tag it with, you know, things
that are mentioned in the news post.

00:02:35.779 --> 00:02:38.780
And that way people can easily
find related

00:02:38.864 --> 00:02:41.665
related content

00:02:41.665 --> 00:02:43.966
content related to your news post.

00:02:43.966 --> 00:02:48.884
So this is about, let's say,
create a new one because this is about

00:02:50.335 --> 00:02:55.004
2025 to 2026

00:02:56.471 --> 00:02:58.005
school year.

00:02:58.005 --> 00:03:00.639
We can have multiple tabs
or multiple tags.

00:03:00.639 --> 00:03:03.640
All we have to do
is put a comma between them.

00:03:04.307 --> 00:03:06.375
And this is also about forms.

00:03:06.375 --> 00:03:09.376
So if people are looking for,
you know, news posts about forms,

00:03:10.393 --> 00:03:12.827
they can easily find them.

00:03:12.827 --> 00:03:15.462
Also, if we want to
we can leave this unpublished.

00:03:15.462 --> 00:03:20.447
Let's say, you know, I got halfway through
working on this and I got pulled away.

00:03:20.447 --> 00:03:23.448
Or, you know,
the content is still in flux.

00:03:24.049 --> 00:03:26.033
I can leave it unpublished.

00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:28.700
Click save.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:33.036
And now when I go to my dashboard,
I can see it's still there.

00:03:33.052 --> 00:03:36.053
But as you saw.

00:03:36.954 --> 00:03:39.955
It's not showing to the public.

00:03:40.639 --> 00:03:42.439
When I'm ready to publish it.

00:03:42.439 --> 00:03:45.157
I can go back and edit

00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:47.358
it, publish and save.

00:03:49.425 --> 00:03:51.610
Now when we view this, we can see.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:54.611
Here are the tags. So we click on farms.

00:03:55.194 --> 00:03:58.179
All we see here
is obviously our one news item.

00:03:58.362 --> 00:04:01.364
But if there were more tagged with farms
we would see all of them.

00:04:05.332 --> 00:04:08.333
Your new news message is also going to be

00:04:08.683 --> 00:04:11.684
posted to the app,

00:04:12.652 --> 00:04:16.386
and it has its own URL here,
so you can copy and paste this into a

00:04:16.403 --> 00:04:17.437
social media post.
